## GXDE Archlinux Qt Probe
### Introduction
This application checks whether your Qt version matches Archlinux upstream.
- If your Qt version is newer than remote then this program returns 7355.
- If your Qt version is older than remote then this program returns 608.
- If your Qt version matches remote version then this program returns 0.

